    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At first sight, these images look like "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " photographs. But in fact, they are all acrylic "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "paintings",
            "zh": "丙烯画"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " created by Jason de Graaf."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Jason is a Canadian "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He first studied "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "illustration",
            "ref": "v-illustration"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and design in college. It was during this time that an artist visited his class and displayed personal works. This "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " made Jason fall in love with painting. Later, after watching "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " artist paint with acrylics, he was inspired and began to develop his own unique style."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The artist now lives and works in Quebec. He often sits for hours, fully "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " creating his artworks. His "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " is very detailed. He always begins by taking photos of his subjects. Then, he carefully draws them on "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "canvas",
            "ref": "v-canvas"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " with a pencil to create an outline. In the end, he "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " uses acrylic paints to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "colour",
            "zh": "给……上色"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " them in. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " process can take several days or even longer. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " results are always amazing and look "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "incredibly",
            "ref": "v-incredibly"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " real."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", Jason doesn’t just paint exactly what he sees. He always "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b11",
            "number": 11
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " his own "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "imagination",
            "ref": "v-imagination"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to his works. If you look "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b12",
            "number": 12
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", you will find many nice and surprising details in these paintings. Such "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b13",
            "number": 13
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " may not exist in real photographs. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b14",
            "number": 14
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these creative details, he is able to turn everyday items into beautiful displays of colour and wonder. Doesn’t he have a pair of "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b15",
            "number": 15
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " hands?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
